{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_handoff_102", "label": "HANDOFF-102 (chat 149 Cowork to chat 150)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Slim handoff form ruled at chat-127 item 5: identity, environment, gate, next work, Drive actions, prompt only; the docket, findings, deferred items and rulings live in their own members so the handoff does not restate them."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_corpus_index_package", "label": "The-Method-1_6-corpus-chat149.zip corpus index package", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built because M directed chat 149 to work out of Graphify and Graphify indexes the repository, not Drive; putting files in a Drive folder does nothing for it. The tree is an index and a convenience, disposable and regenerated per build, never a second source of truth and never patched."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_roundtrip_guard", "label": "Round-trip guard on the member tree", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every member body is spliced back into the original bundle bytes at its recorded offset and the bundle md5 asserted, so a checkout of members/ provably reproduces what the gate extracts rather than merely claiming to."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_gitattributes_no_text", "label": "`.gitattributes` setting `* -text`", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Load-bearing: without it git would normalise line endings on checkout on another platform and silently change every member's md5."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_build179_compendia", "label": "BUILD179 compendia bundle (5,683,169 B, 337 members)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_build90_main", "label": "BUILD90 main bundle (1,983,081 B, 2 members)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_corpus_drive_folder", "label": "Drive CORPUS folder (browsing cache)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A flat second copy of all 339 members that will silently go stale at the next build; read by people, never by instruments, because 'Drive is the store, the bundle is the witness'. It also broke the gate's step-1 CLAUDE.md title search."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_graphify_coverage_measurement", "label": "Graphify coverage measurement (chat 149)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Measured, not assumed: the workspace holds ~30 loose Python files from the Drive folder, 216 nodes / 251 edges / 44 communities, and graphify_find returns 0 for bundle members, so Graphify cannot stand in for Materials."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_github_403_no_repo", "label": "GitHub 403 \u2014 session credential bound to no repository", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_python3_launcher", "label": "/home/claude/bin/python3 interpreter launcher", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "python3 is 3.11 without the f-string backslash of PEP 701 and python3.12 lacks numpy, so the launcher parses each .py and routes it to the interpreter that can run it; PATH must be exported on every gate and close call."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_gate_chat150", "label": "\u00a70 gate for chat 150", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each step its own tool call with a timeout, any FAIL stops the chat with a report; the exactly-one-hit-in-Materials rule survives export duplicates."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_work_order_26b04", "label": "Work order 26b-04 / instrument r2-26b.py", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_102_drive_is_the_store", "label": "Ruling: Drive is the store", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-102.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chat-68 ruling restated in chat 74 and by M in chat 147; any repo or Drive-extracted tree is an index, never a second source of truth."